-- The first two are the corrections V202609020500 documents: the generator emits core procs under
-- this app's Flyway default schema (where none of the 24 used here exist; each was verified in
-- `__mj`) and leaves this app's own procs (spCreateJobFunction, spCreateSeniorityLevel) literal.
